"Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"494d6e39-7750-b6eb-7f72-806302ea1c31"],

Cell["\<\
There were three decoders inside the layer \[LongDash] the minimum-weight \
table, maximum likelihood over cosets, and the detector model's rule \
\[LongDash] but they could only be chosen with a string. Now they are objects:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"39b01e29-d171-5c92-6f4f-9072e00426f8"],

